{#- =====================================================================
  DN_VLAN_Normalize | Day N / brownfield | Jinja2
  Target  : Catalyst 9000 (VTP transparent or off)
  Purpose : Make sure the standard VLANs exist with the standard names.
            Safe to run more than once: it creates or renames VLANs.
            It removes a VLAN only if you list it in retire_vlans.

  Variables:
    vlan_map          string   required   id:name pairs, comma separated
                                          e.g. 10:DATA,20:VOICE,30:IOT,99:MGMT
    retire_vlans      string   optional   comma separated VLAN IDs to delete
                                          e.g. 666,777  (check that no ports use them first)
===================================================================== -#}
{%- for pair in vlan_map.split(',') %}
{%- set parts = pair.split(':') %}
vlan {{ parts[0] | trim }}
 name {{ parts[1] | trim | upper }}
!
{%- endfor %}
{%- if retire_vlans %}
{%- for v in retire_vlans.split(',') %}
no vlan {{ v | trim }}
{%- endfor %}
!
{%- endif %}
